# Red: Red language documentation (red-lang.org), datatypes and syntax; also Rebol; requirements/languages/red.md
name     red reds rebol r3

keyword  func function does has if either unless while until loop repeat foreach forall switch case
keyword  return break continue context make object Red Rebol
builtin  true false none print probe append insert remove first last length? copy form mold reduce
builtin  compose

ident-part     -?!*~
line-comment   ;
string   " "  : escapes
string   { }  : multiline
escape        : char=^
sigil    /    : meta
sigil    #    : meta
key-names  :
operators  +-*/=<>
